Package: clamui
Version: VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCHITECTURE
Depends: clamav, clamav-freshclam, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, pkexec | policykit-1, clamui-privileged-helper (= VERSION)
Maintainer: ClamUI Contributors <clamui@rooki.xyz>
Homepage: https://github.com/linx-systems/clamui
Description: Native desktop interface for the ClamAV antivirus scanner
 ClamUI is a Rust/Tauri desktop application that provides a graphical
 interface for the host-provided ClamAV antivirus command-line tools.
 .
 Features:
  - Scan files and directories for malware
  - View and manage scan results
  - Desktop and file-manager integration
  - Native WebKitGTK and GTK3 runtime integration
 .
 This package requires host ClamAV tools and signatures for scanning and
 updates. Daemon scanning is available when the host clamd service is present.
